"Freedoom Marine", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043702961/", "num_games_owned": 40, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 748, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 699, "last_played": 1762947037, "avatar": "aa01759c16f0b935926d4054f159d84f8ae7dccc"}, "language": "english", "review": "THIS IS SCIENCE FICTION AT ITS BEST! TAKE QUAKE, MEGAMAN, AND METROID, COMBINE THE FULL IDEOLOGIES, AND YOU GET WARFRAME!", "timestamp_created": 1590278092, "timestamp_updated": 1590278092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "69690690", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091272698", "personaname": "poetleg (Joshiks)", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Joshiks/", "num_games_owned": 381, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 46772, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 24453, "last_played": 1767404853, "avatar": "1b9743ef9625349e08ff799570fdc4c34a170104"}, "language": "english", "review": "I dunno havent played it very much buts its pretty fun", "timestamp_created": 1590271479, "timestamp_updated": 1590271479, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "69690329", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147486513", "personaname": "Ren", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198147486513/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 161286, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1044, "playtime_at_review": 99616, "last_played": 1789172640, "avatar": "b9ddd8eec41154b93c813387c1cc387af4bb74e9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Been playing since 2014 and the game is good in general, its enjoyable and all.\n\nBut in summary, it's a farm simulator, devs don't take modern decisions for the game's sake. It'll slowly die as they add more and more unnecessary systems but some updates like \"reworks\" do keep the game alive for a bit longer.  (I'm looking at you Nightwave S2 and S3, and the enemy's armor rework).\n\nThe community is super nice and open to help except in Trade chat or Region. Some people may be toxics but that's on every MMO. In cases like helping newbies, Mods and some high Mastery Rank players do help a lot and are very open!\n\nThe game is easy to learn but there's a lot to learn and it's not simple for a casual to dig in. A lot of the systems are rather outdated, left behind (like the Hoverboard and Archwing missions) and some things are better off deleted or reworked. This stuff might make the game tedious or make it look \"dead\" since there's no one playing those missions or modes anymore.\n\nTL;DR: Game's good. Devs need to listen to the community and make GOOD decisions. If the devs keep making old MMO decisions with endless farming, it'll rot slowly but surely.", "timestamp_created": 1590270962, "timestamp_updated": 1590270962, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.524691402912139893", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}